 thing.\\nThink of that as a bonus!","msg_0628_T29R0201_00006":"{STRVAR_1 52, 0, 0}.{STRVAR_1 50, 1, 0} inches!\\rThat’s wonderful!\\n...Or not.\\fI’ve seen a MAGIKARP\\fof the same size before.","msg_0628_T29R0201_00007":"This MAGIKARP is {STRVAR_1 52, 0, 0}.{STRVAR_1 50, 1, 0} inches.\\rBut I’ve already seen a MAGIKARP that\\nwas {STRVAR_1 52, 2, 0}.{STRVAR_1 50, 3, 0} inches.","msg_0628_T29R0201_00008":"What? That’s not a MAGIKARP!","msg_0628_T29R0201_00009":"...Your Bag is too full!\\nNothing will fit...","msg_0628_T29R0201_00010":"Oh... So you didn’t get one good\\nenough to show me?\\fMaybe next time."},"initTriggers":[],"initScripts":{},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_T29R0201_000":0,"obj_T29R0201_fishing_2":0}}
